; Contents:
; - Default access permits local model files and Metal execution.
; - Network overrides deny external traffic for the daemon and its children.
; - Loopback sockets support the client API and Ollama's local worker processes.
; macOS process-level validation profile; not a portable application sandbox.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network*)
(allow network-bind (local ip "localhost:*"))
(allow network-inbound (local ip "localhost:*"))
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "localhost:*"))
